ADEVICE default
ACHANNELS 1
CHANNEL 0
MYCALL @MYCALL@
MODEM 1200
KISSPORT @KISSPORT@
AGWPORT 0
TXDELAY 10
TXTAIL 5
DWAIT 0

# Optional. A modem with this set is a digipeater and nothing else: it repeats
# frames whose path names it, and answers no queries at all, because there is
# no APRS application behind it. That combination is not a misconfiguration —
# it is what most digipeaters on the air actually are.
@DIGIPEAT@
